    "lyrics": "Fear not, little flock,\nfrom the cross to the throne,\nFrom death into life\nHe went for His own;\nAll power in earth,\nall power above,\nIs given to Him\nfor the flock of His love.\nCHORUS\nOnly believe, only believe,\nAll things are possible,\nOnly believe, Only believe,\nonly believe,\nAll things are possible,\nonly believe.\n(Lord, I believe...)\n(Lord, I receive. .\n(Jesus Is here...)\nFear not, little flock,\nHe goeth ahead,\nYour Shepherd selecteth\nthe path you must tread;\nThe waters of Marah\nll sweeten for thee,\nHe drank all the bitter\nin Gethsemane.\nFear not, little flock,\nwhatever your lot,\nHe enters all rooms,\nthe doors being shut;\nHe never forsakes,\nHe never is gone,\nSo count on His presence\nin darkness and dawn."
