    "lyrics": "Almost persuaded\nnow to believe;\nAlmost persuaded\nChrist to receive;\nSeems now some\nsoul to say, Go, Spirit, go Thy way;\nSome more convenient day,\non Thee I\nll call,\nAlmost persuaded.\nCome, come today;\nAlmost persuaded,\nturn not away;\nJesus invites you here,\nAngels are ling\nring near,\nPrayers rise from hearts so dear;\nOh wand\nrer, come.\nAlmost persuaded, harvest is past!\nAlmost persuaded,\ndoom comes at last!\nAlmost cannot avail;\nAlmost is but to fail!\nSad, sad, that bitter wail:\nAlmost but lost!\nALMOST PERSUADED."
